<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch business confidence rises in June.</title>
<headline>Dutch business confidence rises in June.</headline>
<dateline>VOORBURG, Netherlands 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Dutch business confidence index rose in June from May, the Central Bureau of Statistics (CBS) said.</p>
<p>DUTCH BUSINESS CONFIDENCE INDEX (No base date)</p>
<p>	  June 97	May 97     June 96</p>
<p>	     6.4	   3.3	   0.8</p>
